  "project_description": "GDPR, CCPA & ePrivacy compliant cookie consent banner for Drupal. IAB TCF v2.2 and Google CMP Certified.\n\n Features:\n\n- Injects the Conzent consent banner script into the page head once a website key is verified\n\n- Optional Google Tag Manager container injection with a configurable data-layer name\n\n- Supports both Conzent Cloud and self-hosted (OCI) server URLs\n\n- Single admin settings form; no content entities, plugins, or public endpoints\n\n Configure at Administration > Configuration > System > Conzent CMP.\n\n Requires Drupal 10 or 11, PHP 8.1+.",
